-- =====================================================================
-- Western Region History Museum — Phase 1 seed extension:
-- From the Aurora (the Nov 18, 2026 room joins the back-end model)
-- Project: wlyfawqpsozcclwztmpv
--
-- WHAT THIS DOES
-- Adds the museum's fifth room to public.museum_content in the same
-- generic shape as phase1-supabase.sql: one area row (area:aurora)
-- and fifteen exhibit rows (exhibit:aurora-01 .. exhibit:aurora-15),
-- each carrying its page exactly as the museum file holds it today
-- and its Listen to the Article recording. Structure only; no words
-- were changed in the move. With these rows in place the museum's
-- back-end replacement covers all 56 exhibits, and the admin panel
-- can edit the Aurora room like every other room.
--
-- HOW TO RUN
-- Run AFTER phase1-supabase.sql and phase1-supabase-timeline.sql.
-- Supabase dashboard -> SQL Editor -> New query -> paste -> Run.
-- Idempotent: running it again refreshes these rows.
-- =====================================================================

